        <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
An edit of the downloaded texture -- eg. a light map&apos;s bands moved for the target. Set,
the download goes to \ref rawFile and the edit writes \ref file from it, so the
`section`_ names the EDITED file. Held through its base, so a subclass&apos;s
:cpp:func:`BaseTexEditor::fix` (a `Python`_ one included) is the one that runs.
**Default**: ``nullptr``, the download is \ref file itself
</verbatim> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
